WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.056
- Hi, Peanut.

00:00:01.056 --> 00:00:04.400
(audience clapping)

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.861
- Oh my gosh, Kelly Clarkson!

00:00:06.861 --> 00:00:07.710
- How are you?

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.670
- This is the greatest thing ever.

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.510
I have to tell you, I've been
wanting to come on the show.

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:12.730
Hi, it's good to see you too, Beth.

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:13.563
- Hi, Peanut.

00:00:13.563 --> 00:00:14.396
- Good to see you, nice to meet you.

00:00:14.396 --> 00:00:15.248
Fine, good to see you.

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:16.710
But Kelly!

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:17.690
I wanted to come on your show.

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:20.050
I've been watching your
show (mumbles) forever.

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:21.450
You are so great!

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:22.593
- Oh my god, thank you.

00:00:22.593 --> 00:00:26.240
- And the show is fantastic
and I'm the biggest fan.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:28.840
Has anyone ever said
they're your biggest fan?

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:29.673
- Yes.

00:00:29.673 --> 00:00:30.506
- They are liars!

00:00:30.506 --> 00:00:31.535
(audience laughing)

00:00:31.535 --> 00:00:32.470
It is me.

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:33.303
I am telling you.

00:00:33.303 --> 00:00:35.922
I've loved you since, it's
been what, 17 years now?

00:00:35.922 --> 00:00:36.880
- [Kelly] 17 years.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:37.760
- 17 years.

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:38.851
Oh my gosh, it was so great.

00:00:38.851 --> 00:00:40.710
And then you're standing there and you won

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.856
and everyone's crying and
the confetti's coming down.

00:00:42.856 --> 00:00:44.360
You know, it was way too much (mumbles).

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:45.290
Too much confetti.

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:47.150
But you're crying and
you still had to sing.

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:48.892
And Justin, he's pretending

00:00:48.892 --> 00:00:50.815
that he didn't care that he lost.

00:00:50.815 --> 00:00:52.517
(audience laughing)

00:00:52.517 --> 00:00:53.350
[Peanut] I know, it was great.

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:54.600
It was fantastic, I've
been a fan ever since.

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:56.190
You've reinvented
yourself a couple of times

00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:57.080
and now you have your own talk show!

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:58.594
- Thank you!

00:00:58.594 --> 00:00:59.559
(audience clapping)

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:00.933
I loved talking, Peanut.

00:01:00.933 --> 00:01:01.766
All right.

